    <briefdescription>
<para>Child-first loader for runtime implementation classes that must resolve against the selected XDK runtime rather than the already-loaded plugin classloader. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Only the small implementation package is child-first. Everything else stays parent-first on purpose so the outer plugin API surface, Gradle APIs, and request DTO types are shared rather than duplicated across classloaders. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
